    "name": "Dusk Survivors",
    "steam_appid": 2907330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dusk Survivors</i> is a post-apocalyptic urban tower defense game. The entire city has been submerged by floods of unknown contamination, and nearly everyone has mutated into zombies. You need to navigate the city using various waterborne vehicles. During the day, you must manage your time wisely\u2014whether it's recruiting survivors, building defensive structures, or upgrading ship-mounted weapons\u2014to fend off zombie attacks at dusk and ultimately lead the survivors to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/7a8747aa9b61692e04add65ad30b816b.avif?t=1740739545\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Recruiting Survivors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, you will encounter different survivors. They may either come directly to your camp ready to join you or appear somewhere in the city. Usually, it\u2019s difficult to keep all of them, so you\u2019ll need to manage your time wisely to make the right choices among them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/4a34764baffd266487970b4ce667fcc5.poster.avif?t=1740739545\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/4a34764baffd266487970b4ce667fcc5.webm?t=1740739545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/4a34764baffd266487970b4ce667fcc5.mp4?t=1740739545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Building Defensive Structures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constructing defensive structures is a crucial task, as they play a vital role in effectively fending off zombie attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/c49788198374f2b59e17f1646232fe12.poster.avif?t=1740739545\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/c49788198374f2b59e17f1646232fe12.webm?t=1740739545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/c49788198374f2b59e17f1646232fe12.mp4?t=1740739545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Upgrading Ship-Mounted Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can equip your ship with new weapons or enhance existing ones. Of course, it\u2019s important to consider the unique characteristics of each weapon, as they all have their own attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/96b415cf087308431ac93d9df989f1fa.avif?t=1740739545\" width=600 height=300 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Fending Off Zombie Attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At dusk each day, zombies may attack from one or two directions. We must defend our camp effectively when the zombies launch their assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Constructing New Buildings on Strongholds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different strongholds scattered throughout the city. Building various structures on them can significantly enhance our capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/eed8a7219ba501d65279c1fab3f647b8.poster.avif?t=1740739545\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/eed8a7219ba501d65279c1fab3f647b8.webm?t=1740739545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/eed8a7219ba501d65279c1fab3f647b8.mp4?t=1740739545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Exploring New Unknown Areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At dusk each day, the attacking zombies will grow in numbers and strength. We need to expand to more strongholds to enhance our capabilities. When venturing into a new unknown area, we must prioritize safety, as the noise from weapon attacks may attract more zombies from the surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/d6a8dee4261fe9032a705c625ca1fed0.poster.avif?t=1740739545\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/d6a8dee4261fe9032a705c625ca1fed0.webm?t=1740739545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/d6a8dee4261fe9032a705c625ca1fed0.mp4?t=1740739545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Daily Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, various events may occur in the city. We can head over to investigate and see what\u2019s happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907330/extras/4dec6e466fb17cea036c99f4a5d7273b.avif?t=1740739545\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p>",
